@baseUrl = https://localhost:7126
@productId = ca6f2e9a-24b5-4194-bb2a-66ce34b6a469
@locationId = 204f06e3-e969-41fd-9c7c-1ba6eff901a6

### All stock balances
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/balances?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20

### One product across all locations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/balances?productId={{productId}}

### All products at one location
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/balances?inventoryLocationId={{locationId}}

### One product at one location
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/balances?productId={{productId}}&inventoryLocationId={{locationId}}

### All stock movements
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/movements?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20

### Movement history for one product at one location
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/movements?productId={{productId}}&inventoryLocationId={{locationId}}

### Second page of movements
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/movements?pageNumber=2&pageSize=1

### Invalid page size
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/balances?pageSize=201

### Invalid product ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/balances?productId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Existing purchase movements must still load
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/movements?productId={{productId}}&inventoryLocationId={{locationId}}

### Existing balance must be unchanged
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/balances?productId={{productId}}&inventoryLocationId={{locationId}}